---
description: Verify ingredient restrictions, exact batch results and venue food controls.
args:{ledger:KitchenLedger;requirements:{mandatory:string[];preferences:string[];unverifiedIngredientIds:string[];requiredControls:string[];};tasting:{dishes:Dish[];sharedPrep:SharedPrep[];preferenceNotes:string[];repeatableDefects:string[];invalidatedDishIds:string[];};scaledBatches:ScaledBatch[];batchAudit:BatchReconciliation}
returns:MenuFinding[]
---
Bind lotReview = `checkDishSafetyByLot(ledger, requirements, tasting.dishes)`. Use each lotReview finding's exact dish, ingredient lot and evidence IDs when blocking or requesting a qualified control; do not substitute one dish's verified handling for another. Any batchAudit.blockers or nonempty discrepancies creates a blocked yield finding for every affected selected dish; when the malformed cover or artifact cannot be attributed to a single dish, bind it to the whole service. Preserve supplied-versus-recomputed rows for chef correction; never promote recomputed quantities as production orders without an approved recipe revision. Check that exact scaled quantities reconcile to inventory and budget. An allergen-free representation remains blocked unless venue-specific separation and qualified approval are supplied. Keep subjective tasting findings for chef judgment. Return the union of lotReview findings, exact-batch blockers and discrepancies, service-control findings and tasting defects, retaining each affected dish and repair.
